# GitHub Linguist overrides.
#
# The diagram-generator sources under assets/diagrams/ are authoring tooling
# that emits the book's SVG/Excalidraw figures -- documentation art, not the
# project's application code. Without these overrides Linguist counts ~420 KB
# of diagram Python against the Java services and reports Python as the primary
# language of what is a Java (Quarkus/Spring) modernization reference.
assets/diagrams/*.py linguist-documentation
scripts/generate_diagram.py linguist-documentation

# Editable Excalidraw sources are generated diagram artifacts (JSON), not code.
*.excalidraw linguist-generated

# Rendered figures are vendored assets.
assets/diagrams/*.svg linguist-vendored
